# Sticky section headers: rows added before the visible ones, at the end, and a rotation
# (width change invalidates every predicted row height).
route SectionList
latency 250,700
wait 2.5
mark scroll-mid
repeat 3 pan 200 700 0 -450 300
wait 1.5
mark prepend-start
press 296 80
wait 2.5
mark prepend-burst
repeat 3 press 296 80
wait 3.5
mark append-end
repeat 2 press 333 80
wait 3
mark drag-during-prepend
press 296 80
pan 200 600 0 -150 1500
wait 2.5
mark statusbar-top
statusbar
wait 2.5
mark scroll-then-append
repeat 4 pan 200 750 0 -600 120
wait 1.5
repeat 2 press 333 80
wait 3
# No rotation step: the example app is locked to portrait on iPhone (Info.plist), so
# `ad orientation landscape-left` is a no-op there. Width-change coverage needs an iPad sim.
